Clay: What a surprise. Seein' ya here
while I was inspectin' Twist Mountain.{VAR BE01}
Th' two of ya seem a bit more rugged
than the last time I saw ya.{VAR BE01}
A li'l bit, anyway...{VAR BE01}

Clay: By th' by... You folks seen that
Team Plasma crowd lately?{VAR BE01}
After all the trouble, we Gym Leaders
met up and had a chat.{VAR BE01}
But we've got no clue where they are.
It's like they're hidin' under a rock.{VAR BE01}
Well, not much to do but wait for 'em
to move.{VAR BE01}
Anyhow, this's none o' yer concern.{VAR BE01}
Squirts like the two of ya should just
enjoy travelin' with yer Pokémon.{VAR BE01}

Twist Mountain's a fine place
to explore!{VAR BE01}
You'll have some fun if you just leave
this here path...{VAR BE01}
Weeell... Better ya just see it yerself,
'stead o' listenin' to me yammer.{VAR BE01}

Be seein' ya, sprouts!{VAR BE01}
Feel free to train yerselves on my
mountain fer as long's ya like.{VAR BE01}

Cheren: I thought he was going to get us
involved in all that bother again, so I{VAR BE00}
was bracing myself before I knew it.{VAR BE01}
I'm going in first, but I'll be seeing you.{VAR BE01}
